  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5314,
      "text": "pandangan mereka tertunduk ke bawah, diliputi kehinaan. Dan sungguh, dahulu (di dunia) mereka telah diseru untuk bersujud waktu mereka sehat (tetapi mereka tidak melakukan).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5315,
      "text": "Maka serahkanlah kepada-Ku (urusannya) dan orang-orang yang mendustakan perkataan ini (Al-Qur`an). Kelak akan Kami hukum mereka berangsur-angsur dari arah yang tidak mereka ketahui,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5316,
      "text": "dan Aku memberi tenggang waktu kepada mereka. Sungguh, rencana-Ku sangat teguh.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5317,
      "text": "Ataukah engkau (Muhammad) meminta imbalan kepada mereka, sehingga mereka dibebani dengan hutang?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5318,
      "text": "Ataukah mereka mengetahui yang gaib, lalu mereka menuliskannya?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5319,
      "text": "Maka bersabarlah engkau (Muhammad) terhadap ketetapan Tuhanmu, dan janganlah engkau seperti (Yunus) orang yang berada dalam (perut) ikan ketika dia berdoa dengan hati sedih.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5320,
      "text": "Sekiranya dia tidak segera mendapat nikmat dari Tuhannya, pastilah dia dicampakkan ke tanah tandus dalam keadaan tercela.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5321,
      "text": "Lalu Tuhannya memilihnya dan menjadikannya termasuk orang yang saleh.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5322,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, orang-orang kafir itu hampir-hampir menggelincirkanmu dengan pandangan mata mereka, ketika mereka mendengar Al-Qur`an dan mereka berkata, \"Dia (Muhammad) itu benar-benar orang gila.\"[853]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5323,
      "text": "Padahal Al-Qur`an itu tidak lain adalah peringatan bagi seluruh alam.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5324,
      "text": "Hari kiamat,[854]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5325,
      "text": "apakah hari Kiamat itu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5326,
      "text": "Dan tahukah kamu apakah hari Kiamat itu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5327,
      "text": "Kaum Samud, dan 'Ād telah mendustakan hari Kiamat.[855]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5328,
      "text": "Maka adapun kaum Samud, mereka telah dibinasakan dengan suara yang sangat keras,[856]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5329,
      "text": "sedangkan kaum 'Ād, mereka telah dibinasakan dengan angin topan yang sangat dingin,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5330,
      "text": "Allah menimpakan angin itu kepada mereka selama tujuh malam delapan hari terus-menerus; maka kamu melihat kaum 'Ād pada waktu itu mati bergelimpangan seperti batang-batang pohon kurma yang telah kosong (lapuk).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5331,
      "text": "Maka adakah kamu melihat seorang pun yang masih tersisa di antara mereka? [857]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 566,
